		"advanced" : {
			"description" : "{Advanced Blood Rage}\n\nAdvanced Blood Rage allows the hero's units to accumulate up to 10 Rage Levels in combat. Each Rage Level gives bonuses to the creature stats:\n\n{1}: +1 Damage, {2}: +1 Attack, {3}: +1 Health, {4}: +1 Defense, {5}: +1 Speed\n\n{6}: +2 Damage, {7}: +2 Attack, {8}: +2 Health, {9}: +2 Defense, {10}: +2 Speed\n\nThe bonuses of all achieved Rage Levels are cumulative. Units gain +3 Rage Levels when a buffing Warcry is cast; +2 Rage Levels when they attack; +1 Rage Levels when they take damage; -1 Rage levels when they move, and -2 Rage Levels when they take a defensive stance.",
